{"ticker":"GRMN","updated":"2026-10-30T22:51:20Z","profile":{"longName":"Garmin Ltd.","shortName":"Garmin Ltd.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"Switzerland","website":"https://www.garmin.com","fullTimeEmployees":23000,"marketCap":52542230528,"trailingPE":26.193085,"forwardPE":23.989086,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.6622047,"pegRatio":2.98,"targetMeanPrice":297.75,"targetHighPrice":370.0,"targetLowPrice":220.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":8,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.122,"earningsGrowth":0.346,"grossMargins":0.60436,"operatingMargins":0.30797002,"profitMargins":0.25579,"totalRevenue":7886612992,"beta":0.83,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":314.28,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":186.67,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.5},"summary":"Garmin Ltd. designs, develops, manufactures, markets, and distributes a diverse range of GPS-enabled products and navigation, communications, sensor-based, and information products and services worldwide. It offers running; cycling products; smartwatch devices; scales and monitors; and sports timing and performance analysis; Garmin Connect and Garmin Connect Mobile, which are web and mobile platforms where users can track and analyze their fitness, activities and workouts, and wellness data; and Connect IQ, which enables third parties to create applications that run on Garmin devices. It also provides adventure watches; outdoor handhelds and satellite communicators; golf devices; consumer automotive; dog devices; InReach and Garmin Response; and dive devices. In addition, it designs, manufactures, and markets various aircraft avionics solutions, including integrated flight decks, electronic flight displays and instrumentation, navigation and communication products, automatic flight control systems and safety-enhancing technologies, audio control systems, engine indication systems, traffic awareness and avoidance solutions, ADS-B and transponders, weather information and avoidance solutions, datalink and connectivity solutions, and portable GPS navigators and wearables, as well as service products to the aviation market. Further, it offers chartplotters and multi-function displa","summary_zh":"Garmin Ltd. 在全球範圍內設計、開發、製造、行銷和分銷各種支援 GPS 的產品以及導航、通訊、基於感測器的資訊產品和服務。它提供跑步；騎行產品；智慧手錶設備；體重計和顯示器；以及運動計時和表現分析； Garmin Connect 和 Garmin Connect Mobile，這是網路和行動平台，用戶可以在其中追蹤和分析他們的健身、活動和鍛鍊以及健康數據； Connect IQ，使第三方能夠創建在 Garmin 設備上運行的應用程式。它還提供探險手錶；戶外手持設備和衛星通訊器；高爾夫球具；消費性汽車；狗設備； InReach 和 Garmin Response；和潛水設備。此外，該公司還設計、製造和銷售各種飛機航空電子解決方案，包括整合駕駛艙、電子飛行顯示器和儀表、導航和通訊產品、自動飛行控制系統和安全增強技術、音頻控制系統、發動機指示系統、交通感知和避讓解決方案、ADS-B和應答器、天氣資訊和避讓解決方案、數據鏈和便攜式連接解決方案、ADS-B和應答器、天氣資訊和避讓解決方案、數據鏈和便攜式連接解決方此外，它還提供海圖儀和多功能顯示器","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"科學技術儀器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":237.7,"h":239.66,"l":231.74,"c":234.29,"v":1259200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":234.24,"h":238.09,"l":233.42,"c":236.91,"v":907200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":238.19,"h":240.97,"l":236.53,"c":237.66,"v":965600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":238.48,"h":239.91,"l":235.71,"c":237.39,"v":871900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":237.71,"h":240.51,"l":236.47,"c":239.51,"v":919400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":239.01,"h":239.01,"l":237.33,"c":238.5,"v":547500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":238.33,"h":239.0,"l":235.32,"c":235.96,"v":853000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":237.41,"h":241.84,"l":237.27,"c":241.18,"v":728800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":239.13,"h":240.58,"l":237.71,"c":238.08,"v":528600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":238.81,"h":239.75,"l":235.44,"c":235.83,"v":696400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":234.84,"h":237.2,"l":233.78,"c":236.67,"v":797200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":238.0,"h":238.33,"l":233.02,"c":234.18,"v":622700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":235.74,"h":238.31,"l":234.0,"c":237.25,"v":921000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":238.28,"h":238.53,"l":234.76,"c":235.12,"v":2865600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":234.68,"h":236.76,"l":233.76,"c":236.38,"v":869400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":236.05,"h":239.33,"l":235.29,"c":237.39,"v":587300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":237.23,"h":238.12,"l":235.46,"c"